LAST-MODIFIED:20260609T184539Z
UID:49417-1783103400-1783110600@beachmetro.com
SUMMARY:The Riverdale Open Mic Night
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to join East End Arts for our second season of\, The Riverdale Mic! This is a FREE program meant for local writers\, poets\, musicians\, and creative folks to network\, push themselves up on “stage”\, and have some fun together. \nThe Riverdale Open Mic nights take place at St. Matthew’s Clubhouse on the first Friday of every second month. Signup for each open mic will open at 6:30pm at the door\, with the performances starting at 7pm. It will operate on a first come\, first served basis. East End Arts will provide light refreshments at each event. \nNo tickets are required\, but feel free to RSVP on Facebook if you think you’ll be joining us! \nFull list of Remaining 2026 dates:\nFriday July 3rd\, 2026\, 6:30-8:30PM\nFriday September 4th\, 2026\, 6:30-8:30PM\nFriday November 6th\, 2026\, 6:30-8:30PM\nPotential Bonus Mic Night in December for the holidays – stay tuned for deets!
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/the-riverdale-open-mic-night-2/
LOCATION:St. Matthew’s Clubhouse\, 450 Broadview Avenue\, Toronto\, M4K 2N3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24173213/Mic-IGsm1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="East End Arts":MAILTO:info@eastendarts.ca
END:VEVENT
